{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":54,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"For the Chief Musician. On stringed instruments. A contemplation by David, when the Ziphites came and said to Saul, “Isn’t David hiding himself among us?”"},{"n":1,"text":"Save me, God, by your name. Vindicate me in your might.","tok":[{"t":"Save me, God, "},{"t":"by","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" name. Vindicate me "},{"t":"in","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"your","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" might."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Hear my prayer, God. Listen to the words of my mouth.","tok":[{"t":"Hear "},{"t":"my","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" prayer, "},{"t":"God","s":["H3808"]},{"t":". Listen "},{"t":"to","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H5973"]},{"t":" words "},{"t":"of","s":["H3808"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H1732"]},{"t":" mouth."}]},{"n":3,"text":"For strangers have risen up against me. Violent men have sought after my soul. They haven’t set God before them. Selah.","tok":[{"t":"For","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" strangers "},{"t":"have","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" risen up against "},{"t":"me","s":["H3467"]},{"t":". Violent "},{"t":"men","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"have","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" sought "},{"t":"after","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H3467"]},{"t":" soul. "},{"t":"They","s":["H8034"]},{"t":" haven’t set God before "},{"t":"them","s":["H3467"]},{"t":". Selah."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Behold, God is my helper. The Lord is the one who sustains my soul.","tok":[{"t":"Behold, God "},{"t":"is","s":["H6310"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"my","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" helper. "},{"t":"The","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" Lord "},{"t":"is","s":["H6310"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"the","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"one","s":["H6310"]},{"t":" who sustains "},{"t":"my","s":["H8085"]},{"t":" soul."}]},{"n":5,"text":"He will repay the evil to my enemies. Destroy them in your truth.","tok":[{"t":"He","s":["H3588"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H5315"]},{"t":" repay "},{"t":"the","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" evil "},{"t":"to","s":["H5921"]},{"t":" 